                                                "sense_id": "9b1e3f30-a18c-3dae-86e4-62fd55ef2eac",
                                                "text": "He sat down in the middle of the floor, took his chalk out and marked a large ring around him, and round about this he wrote the Lord's Prayer, and then he did not feel afraid even if Old Nick himself should come."
                                            }
